  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Supporting Elections for Ethiopia&#x2019;s Democracy Strengthening (SEEDS) project in Ethiopia, implemented by (UNDP), supports the National Election Board Ethiopia&#x2019;s (NEBE) technical capacity, independence and credibility. Objectives include enhancing the capacity of various electoral and election-related stakeholders, supporting transparent and inclusive electoral operations and incorporating gender-sensitivity in electoral policies and processes. Key activities include legal reform, training and professional development of election officials, NEBE&#x2019;s communications, media campaigns.</narrative>
  </description>
